1</text><text x="1511.5" y="418.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">138.</text><text x="1439.5" y="447.0" font-family="Noto Serif CJK SC" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">Вечером</text><text x="1527.0" y="447.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1531.9" y="447.0" font-family="Noto Serif CJK SC" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">соберём</text><text x="1617.0" y="447.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1621.8" y="447.0" font-family="Noto Serif CJK SC" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">чемоданы</text><text x="1726.3" y="447.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">.</text><rect x="1439.5" y="481.0" width="60" height="30" rx="2.7" fill="#37402f"/><text x="1456.4" y="503.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">B2</text><text x="1511.5" y="504.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">139.</text><text x="1439.5" y="533.0" font-family="Noto Serif CJK SC" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">Итоги</text><text x="1503.6" y="533.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1508.5" y="533.0" font-family="Noto Serif CJK SC" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">ещё</text><text x="1549.4" y="533.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1554.2" y="533.0" font-family="Noto Serif CJK SC" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">неизвестны</text><text x="1677.3" y="533.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">.</text><text x="1439.5" y="591.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">F</text><text x="1455.5" y="591.0" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1479.5" y="591.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">LES MOTS</text><text x="1612.1" y="591.0" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1636.1" y="591.0" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">Слова</text><line x1="1439.5" y1="604.0" x2="1862.0" y2="604.0" stroke="#46581f" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="1439.5" y="617.0" width="60" height="30" rx="2.7" fill="#46581f"/><text x="1456.4" y="639.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">B1</text><text x="1511.5" y="640.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">140–144.</text><text x="1635.5" y="640.0" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="19.5" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">Соотнеси</text><text x="1439.5" y="681.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">140. un sénateur</text><text x="1439.5" y="718.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">141. un vainqueur</text><text x="1439.5" y="755.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">142. un tirage</text><text x="1439.5" y="792.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">143. un vin primeur</text><text x="1439.5" y="829.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">144. un déchet</text><text x="1473.5" y="874.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="23" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">a. un élu du Sénat</text><text x="1473.5" y="912.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="23" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">b. le joueur qui a gagné le tournoi</text><text x="1473.5" y="950.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="23" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">c. le sort qui fait les groupes</text><text x="1473.5" y="988.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="23" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">d. un vin de l'année, très jeune</text><text x="1473.5" y="1026.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="23" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">e. ce qu'on jette</text><text x="1439.5" y="1102.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">G</text><text x="1458.9" y="1102.0" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1482.9" y="1102.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">DIALOGUE</text><text x="1623.9" y="1102.0" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1647.9" y="1102.0" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="24" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">Диалог</text><line x1="1439.5" y1="1115.0" x2="1862.0" y2="1115.0" stroke="#46581f" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="1439.5" y="1128.0" width="60" height="30" rx="2.7" fill="#5c6e30"/><text x="1455.7" y="1150.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">A2</text><text x="1505.5" y="1150.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19.5" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">145.</text><rect x="1562.625" y="1128.0" width="60" height="30" rx="2.7" fill="#5c6e30"/><text x="1578.8" y="1150.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">A2</text><text x="1628.6" y="1150.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19.5" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">146.</text><rect x="1685.75" y="1128.0" width="60" height="30" rx="2.7" fill="#46581f"/><text x="1702.6" y="1150.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">B1</text><text x="1751.8" y="1150.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19.5" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">147.</text><rect x="1439.5" y="1166.0" width="60" height="30" rx="2.7" fill="#5c6e30"/><text x="1455.7" y="1188.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">A2</text><text x="1505.5" y="1188.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19.5" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">148.</text><rect x="1562.625" y="1166.0" width="60" height="30" rx="2.7" fill="#5c6e30"/><text x="1578.8" y="1188.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">A2</text><text x="1628.6" y="1188.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19.5" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">149.</text><text x="1439.5" y="1226.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">— Tu vas au cinéma mercredi ? — Oui, pour</text><text x="1439.5" y="1257.92" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">voir Hunger Games. — Tu as pris (145)___ ?</text><text x="1439.5" y="1289.84" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">— Oui, (146)___ billets. — La séance est à</text><text x="1439.5" y="1321.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">(147)___ ? — À 20 heures. — On se retrouve</text><text x="1439.5" y="1353.68" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">(148)___ cinéma ? — Oui, à 19 h 30. Bon</text><text x="1439.5" y="1385.6" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">(149)___ ! — Merci !</text><line x1="88" y1="1486" x2="1862.0" y2="1486" stroke="#46581f" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="88.0" y="1500" width="60" height="30" rx="2.7" fill="#46581f"/><text x="104.9" y="1522" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="start">B1</text><text x="160.0" y="1526" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">H</text><text x="182.1" y="1526" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="207.1" y="1526" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">ÉCRITURE</text><text x="349.0" y="1526" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="374.0" y="1526" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">Письмо</text><text x="88.0" y="1562" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">Écrivez un petit texte (80 à 100 mots) : « Mon dimanche 22 novembre ». Racontez : une</text><text x="88.0" y="1593.175" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">finale, une promenade, un film. Les meilleurs textes paraîtront dans le VOL.5 (page 7, «</text><text x="88.0" y="1624.35" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">Le courrier des lecteurs »).</text><text x="88.0" y="1690" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">Напиши</text><text x="172.1" y="1690" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start"> 80–100 </text><text x="252.5" y="1690" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">слов</text><text x="298.3" y="1690" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="303.2" y="1690" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">по</text><text x="328.0" y="1690" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">-</text><text x="335.5" y="1690" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">французски</text><text x="455.2" y="1690" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">: </text><text x="465.6" y="1690" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">Моё</text><text x="507.6" y="1690" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="512.5" y="1690" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">воскресенье</text><text x="638.8" y="1690" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start"> 22 </text><text x="672.5" y="1690" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">ноября</text><text x="744.9" y="1690" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">. </text><text x="754.2" y="1690" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">Опиши</text><text x="827.5" y="1690" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="832.4" y="1690" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">финал</text><text x="897.1" y="1690" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">,</text><text x="88.0" y="1718.0" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">прогулку</text><text x="177.9" y="1718.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="182.8" y="1718.0" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">или</text><text x="221.4" y="1718.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="226.2" y="1718.0" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">фильм</text><text x="294.0" y="1718.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="20" fill="#6f675d" text-anchor="start">.</text><rect x="989.0" y="1500" width="873.0" height="288" rx="0" fill="#f0eee5"/><text x="1011.0" y="1538" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="23" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">MODÈLE</text><text x="1121.6" y="1538" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="23" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1144.6" y="1538" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="23" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">Образец</text><text x="1011.0" y="1574" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">Dimanche 22 novembre, je me suis levé tard : c'était le jour des finales de Turin. Le</text><text x="1011.0" y="1603.82" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">matin, j'ai lu le journal : Alcaraz a gagné Paris, le Sénat a voté mercredi. L'après-midi,</text><text x="1011.0" y="1633.6399999999999" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">nous avons regardé les finales à la télévision, avec des chips. Le soir, nous avons</text><text x="1011.0" y="1663.4599999999998" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">regardé Marseille – Le Mans, à 20 h 45. J'ai noté les mots nouveaux dans mon cahier :</text><text x="1011.0" y="1693.2799999999997" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">un vainqueur, un tirage, une finale. Lundi, je suis retourné à l'école avec une photo de</text><text x="1011.0" y="1723.0999999999997" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="21" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">Méliès dans la tête. C'était une semaine en trois temps : voter, fêter, jouer.</text><line x1="88" y1="1800" x2="1862.0" y2="1800" stroke="#46581f" stroke-width="2"/><text x="88.0" y="1838" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">RÉPONSES</text><text x="238.9" y="1838" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="264.9" y="1838" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">ВСЕ</text><text x="313.5" y="1838" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="319.5" y="1838" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">ОТВЕТЫ</text><text x="425.2" y="1838" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="431.2" y="1838" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">С</text><text x="447.8" y="1838" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="453.9" y="1838" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">КОРОТКИМИ</text><text x="627.6" y="1838" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="633.7" y="1838" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">ЗАМЕТКАМИ</text><text x="803.9" y="1838" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start"> (</text><text x="818.5" y="1838" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">С</text><text x="835.0" y="1838" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">. 1–8)</text><text x="88.0" y="1877.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">— </text><text x="103.7" y="1877.0" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start">СТРАНИЦА</text><text x="197.9" y="1877.0" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="17" font-weight="700" fill="#46581f" text-anchor="start"> 1 —</text><text x="88.0" y="1917.26" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">1. gagné</text><text x="146.5" y="1917.26" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-s