</text><text x="1258.3" y="2324.61" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">127. A (</text><text x="1312.7" y="2324.61" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">Марсель</text><text x="989.0" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">20:45)</text><text x="1035.3" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1050.8" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">128. A (</text><text x="1105.2" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">В</text><text x="1115.3" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1119.1" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">пн</text><text x="1138.9" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">. </text><text x="1146.1" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">в</text><text x="1155.3" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1159.1" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">школу</text><text x="1208.5" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">)</text><text x="1213.4" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1228.9" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">129. A (</text><text x="1283.2" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">В</text><text x="1293.4" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1297.2" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">школу</text><text x="1346.6" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1350.4" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">в</text><text x="1359.6" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1363.4" y="2344.76" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">пн</text><text x="1383.1" y="2344.76" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">.)</text><text x="989.0" y="2364.9100000000003" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">130. Le Sénat va voter mercredi. (aller + </text><text x="1273.8" y="2364.9100000000003" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">инф</text><text x="1305.7" y="2364.9100000000003" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">.)</text><text x="1314.2" y="2364.9100000000003" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1329.7" y="2364.9100000000003" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">131. Si tu</text><text x="989.0" y="2385.0600000000004" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">venais dimanche, tu verrais les finales. (si + </text><text x="1296.6" y="2385.0600000000004" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">имперфект</text><text x="1384.1" y="2385.0600000000004" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">)</text><text x="989.0" y="2405.21" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">132. Il a goûté le beaujolais à Beaujeu. (passé composé: a +</text><text x="989.0" y="2425.36" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">прич</text><text x="1028.4" y="2425.36" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">.)</text><text x="1037.0" y="2425.36" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1052.5" y="2425.36" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">133. Selon moi, la semaine est bien remplie. (selon</text><text x="989.0" y="2445.51" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">moi = </text><text x="1032.4" y="2445.51" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">по</text><text x="1051.7" y="2445.51" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">-</text><text x="1057.5" y="2445.51" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">моему</text><text x="1108.0" y="2445.51" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">)</text><text x="1112.8" y="2445.51" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1128.3" y="2445.51" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">134. Il est prévu que le Sénat examine</text><text x="989.0" y="2465.6600000000003" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">le texte mercredi. (il est prévu que + </text><text x="1245.5" y="2465.6600000000003" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">сосл</text><text x="1279.4" y="2465.6600000000003" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">.)</text><text x="1287.9" y="2465.6600000000003" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1303.4" y="2465.6600000000003" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">135. Regarder</text><text x="989.0" y="2485.8100000000004" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">une finale, c'est déjà apprendre le français. (regarder =</text><text x="989.0" y="2505.96" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">смотреть</text><text x="1061.1" y="2505.96" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start"> </text><text x="1064.9" y="2505.96" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">финал</text><text x="1115.0" y="2505.96" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">)</text><text x="1119.9" y="2505.96" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1135.4" y="2505.96" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">136. Il court plus vite que son frère.</text><text x="989.0" y="2526.11" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">(</text><text x="993.9" y="2526.11" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">Сравн</text><text x="1041.3" y="2526.11" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">.: plus vite)</text><text x="1118.9" y="2526.11" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1134.4" y="2526.11" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">137. Nous suivons le vote du Sénat</text><text x="989.0" y="2546.26" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">depuis lundi. (depuis + </text><text x="1152.7" y="2546.26" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">день</text><text x="1190.2" y="2546.26" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">)</text><text x="1195.0" y="2546.26" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1210.5" y="2546.26" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">138. Ce soir, nous allons</text><text x="1439.5" y="1875.5" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">préparer nos affaires. (futur proche + préparer)</text><text x="1770.1" y="1875.5" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1785.6" y="1875.5" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">139. On</text><text x="1439.5" y="1895.65" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">ne connaît pas encore les résultats. (ne...pas encore = </text><text x="1815.6" y="1895.65" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">пока</text><text x="1439.5" y="1915.8" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">нет</text><text x="1466.1" y="1915.8" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">)</text><text x="1470.9" y="1915.8" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1486.4" y="1915.8" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">140. a (sénateur = </text><text x="1615.2" y="1915.8" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">сенатор</text><text x="1677.2" y="1915.8" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1692.7" y="1915.8" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">a)</text><text x="1705.5" y="1915.8" font-family="Noto Sans CJK SC" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">　</text><text x="1721.0" y="1915.8" font-family="Newsreader" font-size="15.5" fill="#302c28" text-anchor="start">141. b (vainqueur =</text><text x="1439.5" y="1935.95" font-family="Noto Sans" font-size="15.5" fill="#